flowchart TB
    Q["Qualified workload envelope<br/>Quality, load, safety and recovery constraints"]:::check
    H["Feasible hardware candidates<br/>Measured constraints before cost ranking"]:::main
    QUOTE["Dated quotations and assumptions<br/>Currency, volume, exclusions, uncertainty"]:::store
    FIX["Fixed costs<br/>Engineering, IP, tools, qualification, NRE"]:::main
    UNIT["Delivered unit costs<br/>Board or die, yield, package, test, spares"]:::main
    OP["Operating costs<br/>Power, cooling, support, maintenance, downtime"]:::main
    COLO["Colocation and access<br/>Rack, cross-connect, ports, feeds, entitlements"]:::main
    SC["Volume and lifecycle scenarios<br/>Base, downside, upside and refresh"]:::main
    MODEL["TCO, NPV and break-even<br/>Explicit discount and uncertainty models"]:::check
    DEC["Decision with sensitivity<br/>No profit inferred from nanoseconds alone"]:::store
    PROC["ASIC process metadata<br/>Foundry, libraries, layer mix, package"]:::future
    Q --> H
    QUOTE --> FIX & UNIT & OP & COLO
    H & FIX & UNIT & OP & COLO & SC --> MODEL --> DEC
    PROC -->|qualified inputs only| FIX & UNIT

